# PMS

- React + Vite + Tailwind + shadcn. Staff ops only → `apps/api`.
- Call API only via `src/lib/api`; shared wire types from `packages/` — do not duplicate cross-app contracts here.
- Calendar, reservations, check-in/out, quick-confirm first.
- Read `apps/pms/AGENTS.md`.

## UI skills (PMS only)

From `.cursor/skills/`: use **`shadcn`** then **`product-ui-design`** only.

Do **not** load `ui-design-brain` / `ui-craft*` for PMS (reserved for `apps/web`). No marketing/landing design skills on PMS.
